WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.422 --> 00:00:03.738
PETER QUILL
We're the Guardians of the Galaxy.

00:00:05.109 --> 00:00:07.883
MANTIS
You feel romantic, sexual love.

00:00:07.933 --> 00:00:08.692
PETER QUILL
No, no I don't.

00:00:08.742 --> 00:00:09.243
MANTIS
For her!

00:00:09.293 --> 00:00:09.827
PETER QUILL
No.

00:00:10.021 --> 00:00:11.103
DRAX
[Laughing]

00:00:12.584 --> 00:00:13.222
GROOT
I am Groot.

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:14.365
ROCKET
No! Try again.

00:00:14.583 --> 00:00:15.315
GROOT
I am Groot.

00:00:15.365 --> 00:00:15.824
ROCKET
No!

00:00:15.874 --> 00:00:18.544
GROOT
I am Groot!

00:00:21.413 --> 00:00:22.197
MANTIS
That is sad.

00:00:24.608 --> 00:00:25.912
PETER QUILL
You know what's sad?

00:00:25.963 --> 00:00:27.669
People on Earth die when 
they're like fifty.

00:00:27.968 --> 00:00:29.696
MANTIS
Are you about to die?!

00:00:30.077 --> 00:00:30.964
PETER QUILL
I'm not fifty!

00:00:34.557 --> 00:00:36.557
♫ Hooked on a feeling ♫

00:00:37.674 --> 00:00:39.147
PETER QUILL
So what should we do next?

00:00:40.999 --> 00:00:43.519
PETER QUILL
Something good, something bad.

00:00:46.901 --> 00:00:47.721
NEBULA
Knock it off!

00:00:47.772 --> 00:00:48.205
PETER QUILL
What?

00:00:48.255 --> 00:00:49.474
ROCKET
You got issues, Quill.

00:00:49.524 --> 00:00:50.234
PETER QUILL
Oh, come on.

00:00:50.285 --> 00:00:51.689
DRAX
Yeah! [Laughing]

00:00:51.746 --> 00:00:55.397
GROOT
We are Groot!

